      "summary": "Evidence summary: 6 validated structured observations; consult observations and conflicts for supported findings.",
      "observations": [
        {
          "category": "structure",
          "statement": "The game is primarily a choice-driven adult visual novel built around long dialogue sequences, branching decisions, multiple endings and occasional puzzles; player feedback often treats the puzzles as a weak part of the loop.",
