            "feedback-003"
          ]
        },
        {
          "category": "other",
          "statement": "Presentation is often judged stronger than the writing: renders and character models receive praise, while animation quality, repeated music and lack of voice work are criticized as dated or uneven.",
          "sentiment": "mixed",
          "recurrence": "moderate",
          "mention_count": 5,
          "evidence_languages": [
